{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1364647-you-re-an-exalted-in-a-comic-book-setting","id":1364647,"title":"You're an Exalted in a comic book setting","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-02-01T17:44:22-08:00","id":1364647,"title":"You're an Exalted in a comic book setting","content":"an Exaltation of your choice(whichever type and caste).<br /> <span style=\"color:#CCCCCC\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> You to decide which comic book setting sends you to.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#CCCCCC\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Where will you go? And what will you do?</span></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12378-fma245","name":"FMA245","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"165"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-02T01:03:25-08:00","id":1364713,"title":"","content":"I make a Resistance Supernal Zenith and go HAM on Rez/Brawl/Athletics picking up the Strength stuff from Ath and the grapple stuff from Brawl and drop a few utility charms into Presence and Awareness. My Appearance is 5 and Charisma is 4. I take the Giant Merit and the ones that let me metabolize poison. I am now a glorious beautiful divine being nigh impossible to wound by sword, assassin, or poison. I can rip Lions apart with my hands, wrestle bears, and throw a man across a field. <br /> <br /> I jump into the Conan comic books and travel as he does, winning fame and treasure and followers. I use my Presence and Charisma to make armies, i pick up a War charm or two to lead them. I crush enemy kings on the field between my mighty fists and take their kingdoms as conquerer. I expand my boarders via conquest after conquest, slowly picking up Socialize, War, and Bureaucracy charms as I need them. My kingdoms become Empire. I extend the olive branch to the dark sorcerer's of Stygia and the evil but powerful occult masters. They can become my vassals and I will provide them with riches and arcane components from across the world, or they can join fully and ignore the daily trivialites of rule. The stubborn ones, which is most of them, can die at my hands like mongrel dogs. Their arcane artifacts given to my loyal mages, their secrets plundered by my scholars. I am initiated into Sorcery.<br /> <br /> By my second century, I am the only Super Power on the continent. My troops can defeat triple their number in battle, but my logistics pave the way for me to field armies greater than the rest of the Land combined. My poets and artisans are the worlds best, my capital is the cultural Mecca of this world. My legion of children manage my lands, and my almighty Presence abilities keep them worshipping me as God-King. It gets easier to convince all of my divinity yeatlr after year as I do not age. My first children are long dead by the time I leave lands to be client states ruled by my great-great-great grandchildren. Each appointed by me, not merely handed down father to son. No assassin could dream of killing me, and the Sorcerers fear that their magics will not protect them from me, especially as by now I have mastered spell in months which took them a century to learn. <br /> <br /> By the height of my 3rd century, I am the greatest Sorcerer of all time. I am into the Celestial Circle if not the Solar one. I have Demons bound to my will, terrifying agents of twisted power which are zealously loyal to me. My church has spread through the land, and I am openly worshipped as a true god. Artifacts are made with regularity, my city is a shining gem on a hill which all other cities bow to in meekness: flowing crystal clear canals, perfumed jungle gardens, grand bazaars and opulent guards of intense martial ability. My empire stretches from what will be Europe to the Indian sea. Tales of my early adventures are this world's Illiad, Shakespeare, 3 kingdoms romance. <br /> <br /> Neighboring countries have great embassies of my land, and there is peace and trade between us. Peace based on fear of my power and the riches grom my Merchants. <br /> <br /> I rule for millenia, mastering the growth of peaches of youth. When i tire of rule, i sail west into the unknown lands of prehistoric mesoamerica and live or die on that savage land. I kill whatever gods live there if any and reach apotheosis.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Please be warned: this is not champagne, this is most likely a duck.<br /> -<i>Chausse</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\"><i>Message me for Japanese translations.</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8830-sorcerous-overlord","name":"Sorcerous Overlord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8830_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-02T07:09:48-08:00","id":1364750,"title":"","content":"Linguistics Supernal Eclipse, go to any modern-day setting where Twitter exists, brainwash everyone into worshipping me with one tweet?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12314-grod_the_giant","name":"Grod_the_giant","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12314_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-16T18:43:47-08:00","id":1368442,"title":"","content":"Star Wars is a comic book setting.<br /> <br /> I would like to go there as a 2e Infernal. I can mimic everything the Jedi can do and more, without their being able to counter it. Subvert Darth Vader to my side by offering to heal him fully, then use Green Sun Nimbus Flare's upgrades to make sure that Palpatine stays dead and take the throne to rule a more enlightened Empire. Pity the Yuuzhan Vong when they come for me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}